title: Loom — six-lens creative panel converged; the architecture + the kill shot + the weekend proof
summary: 'The Loom invention panel (Arky/Cid/Loid/Aegis/Performance/Jinx) converged on a coherent architecture AND its de-risking move. THE MACHINE: the WARP (content-addressed MEANING store = source of truth) → WEAVE (deterministic projection to compiler-edible text; text is a regenerable cache) → ABSORB (re-ingest edits as typed SemDeltas); law = absorb(weave(W))≡W per language lens. The ATOM is the ''Justification'' = {actor, intent, semantic-delta, COMPUTED ripple-closure, signed witness} — impact + accountability welded into identity; a Justification is malformed if its declared ripple != graph closure. STRUCTURAL IDENTITY: hash a symbol''s meaning (kind + normalized contract + edges-by-target-hash), NOT its name/path → renames/moves are free, no name-conflicts; ''hash moves iff meaning moves''. MERGE: SemDeltas commute by type; conflict = two intents contradicting on one symbol → becomes a recorded DECISION; ripple detects dangling/semantic conflicts text can''t; CONSOLIDATE folds N non-intersecting branches silently (the killer feature). ACCOUNTABILITY (the new category, Loid): trust is a DOMAIN-SCOPED vector from the Classroom; SCRUTINY = symbol_fragility × (1 − author_trust_in_domain); attribution is to the author''s PREDICTED ripple (calibration/Brier), not the diff — honest uncertainty is trust-positive; the self-closing loop = merge → field-break → trust-adjust → harder next review; Shadow Panel (counterfactual after-the-fact review of auto-merged changes) is the falsifiability guard and ships in v1. PROVENANCE (Aegis): Custody Chain = operator_sig (human, hardware root) → runtime_sig (model+version) → agent_claim (archetype+notebook-rev); agent identity is the HASH of its training, unforgeable; session-scoped delegation certs for machine-scale authoring; web-of-trust (no central authority, clones may disagree), nevr.land relays signed replayable evidence not scores. SPACE (Performance): store meaning, regenerate bytes; cosmetic churn/renames cost ~0; branch = overlay of changed SU-refs so 50 live branches ≈ 1.25× base not 50×; projection cached by temperature (hot/warm/cold). TRIPLE-CONVERGED HARD PART (Arky+Cid+Aegis independently): deterministic derivation of ''essence''/normalized-meaning is THE load-bearing wall — NEVER put LLM embeddings in the hash; hash only the STRUCTURED contract; quarantine subjectivity into signed, reviewable, revocable !essence-equivalence edges. JINX''S KILL SHOT: ''meaning-primary, bytes-projected'' is a false ground truth — code is the source, meaning is a lossy inference; when >40% of a real polyglot repo lands in the opaque-bytes escape hatch it''s a sidecar not a source; a clean graph-merge can be silently semantically broken (worse than a text conflict that stops you); trust-weighting routes review AWAY from exactly the high-trust subtle-bug author (xz/Jia Tan is a machine-speed trust farm); the Classroom→trust→repo→Classroom loop is circular self-grading with no exogenous oracle. THE WEEKEND PROOF (Jinx, accepted): the Convergence/Divergence Oracle — read-only on git, zero data loss: hand-build (A) textually-disjoint-but-semantically-breaking and (B) textually-conflicting-but-semantically-identical branch pairs; have Loom-as-read-only-oracle predict A=conflict, B=clean-noop; score vs hand ground truth. If it nails both directions, meaning carries merge-info bytes don''t and the category is real; if not, it''s git+metadata and the honest call is ''make Paradigm-on-git great''. CONDITIONS TO PROCEED: bytes stay durable truth + meaning is a FALSIFIABLE index (at least until the Oracle passes); trust SCHEDULES attention never REPLACES review (no un-reviewed merge-to-trunk by trust score, ever). Name LOOM adopted (warp/weft/weave/justification/consolidate/warp-draw).'
